Package: droidloom-image
Version: @DEB_VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: EvilBorsch <44337169+EvilBorsch@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: droidloom-base (>= @BASE_PKGVER@-@BASE_PKGREL@~), droidloom-base (<< @BASE_PKGVER@-@BASE_NEXT_PKGREL@~)
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/denialwm/droidloom
Description: Droidloom Android components (vendor image and framework overrides)
 The Droidloom-built Android vendor partition (Mesa Freedreno/Turnip, Composer,
 audio, power, Wi-Fi and allocator services) and the files Droidloom puts over
 the AOSP base partitions: SurfaceFlinger, InputFlinger, services.jar,
 SystemUI, IME, vold, netd and init compatibility.
 .
 It must match droidloom-runtime exactly; it names the droidloom-base release
 it needs. Repacked unchanged from the upstream Arch Linux ARM package
 droidloom-image @PKGVER@-@PKGREL@ (commit @COMMIT@).
